<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Duwa</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Duwa was a khan of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/chagatai-khanate">Chagatai Khanate</a> in the late thirteenth and early fourteenth centuries. An ally of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kaidu">Kaidu</a> in the wars against the Yuan, he also directed raids into <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/india">India</a> against the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/delhi-sultanate">Delhi Sultanate</a>. His reign marked a period of renewed strength for the Chagatai Empire.</p></div>
